                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ae0be1ed-1978-3cec-a560-64ec829926af",
                        "entry_id": "78c37431-7400-3c78-93b7-61f94b73df5d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полит. захват власти неорганизованным народом; власть толпы, господство низших, неимущих классов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bca5774-a18d-491b-96f8-bf7b82adb54b",
                                "sense_id": "ae0be1ed-1978-3cec-a560-64ec829926af",
                                "text": "Всякая демократическая власть казалась ему либо утопией, либо охлократией, господством черни."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae13b55d-71b8-46fb-b6c6-46772e198298",
                                "sense_id": "ae0be1ed-1978-3cec-a560-64ec829926af",
                                "text": "Есть уровень необразованности, малообразованности и неосведомленности, при котором голосует не народ, а обманываемая толпа; и из этого возникает не демократия, а охлократия (правление темной толпы)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b09a47e2-3688-4609-9bfc-8bc127d3347a",
                        "source_entry_id": "78c37431-7400-3c78-93b7-61f94b73df5d",
                        "source_sense_id": "ae0be1ed-1978-3cec-a560-64ec829926af",
                        "target_lang_word": "ochlocracy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ochlocracy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db74e3c8-c0ae-3ca3-ad1c-73b52d477ae3",
                                        "entry_id": "292653f9-0186-3b06-ade6-d058708f5bb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mob rule; government by the masses; mobocracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76a6e87b-d8bd-48c4-86e1-51b35d10a01f",
                                                "sense_id": "db74e3c8-c0ae-3ca3-ad1c-73b52d477ae3",
                                                "text": "Referendums are snapshots of sentiment at a given point in time. Government by referendum is government by crowd acclamation: not democracy, but ochlocracy. That is exactly why we have representative democracy. If referendums would be a poor way to decide on health and safety, air traffic control, or education, they are an exceedingly poor way to decide a matter as momentous as membership of the EU. This is and should be a matter for Parliament, taking all factors into account."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4338b099-7dfd-4094-b939-832f7c278197",
                                                "sense_id": "db74e3c8-c0ae-3ca3-ad1c-73b52d477ae3",
                                                "text": "This constitutes a grave threat to the American Republic and degrades it into an Ochlocracy, or government by mob rule."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
